        "id": 2022147
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-23T20:43:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if no policy exists for a UID, by default, it is allowed\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/kernel/common/+/android16-6.12-desktop:security/safesetid/lsm.c;drc\u003db1a867eeb8ab5e097178728b01cc504c6806acca;l\u003d196\n\nso we can develop policy later when needed.",
      "parentUuid": "97b27182_27127f8a",
      "revId": "0ec7a5c54015153daf0e9868fe8fc677f88d68c2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
